  <item>
    <title>27. 自驾5千公里！森林夜路，炫海鲜，大西洋日落以及？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/673e79453e619807d55c7b8d</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">673e79453e619807d55c7b8d</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 21 Nov 2024 00:00:30 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>《不远不近》第27期，苏苏决定开着自己的车到加拿大东边海洋三省（Maritimes）转转，结果一开就是五千公里。</span><br><span>话说这个播客怎么逐渐成为了一个旅游播客……</span></p><span></span><p><span>【聊了什么】</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="28">00:28</a> 自驾了五千公里后累成个啥了！</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="493">08:13</a> 两次森林夜路，两个惊悚故事</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1086">18:06</a> 性格完全不同的旅游搭子24/7呆13天，会碰撞出什么火花？</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1522">25:22</a> 什么？airbnb还能住出《寄生虫》？</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2035">33:55</a> 干嘛总跟石头过不去：拾荒捡石头，买石头戒指</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2180">36:20</a> 原来极致J人也会突然剑走偏锋的哦？</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2349">39:09</a> 疯狂吃当季的龙虾和海鲜后，亚洲胃对白人饭绝望</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2938">48:58</a> 自然而然地其中一人会成为旅途中的“男人”</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3312">55:12</a> i人怎么会在旅途中老跟陌生人聊天啊？</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3911">01:05:11</a> 意外灵感收获：要如何更清晰自己在世界中的定位？</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4410">01:13:30</a> 当计划型遇上随机性</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4546">01:15:46</a> 大西洋的日落，漆黑的野外，不能只选前者吗？</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4843">01:20:43</a> 明明已经很会做攻略，居然受到了挑战！</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4990">01:23:10</a> 灵魂拷问：以后还会一起旅游吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期旅途苏苏还写了长文游记：</span><a href="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzIwODk2MjgwMw==&amp;mid=2247485021&amp;idx=1&amp;sn=21c997ea9376a54308165d13f7587fe7&amp;chksm=977a53c1a00ddad755a4c45098b4d709fac828e9f7e8f5f9b1cebe0a6bff4db831e16d93f43c&amp;token=2100448117&amp;lang=zh_CN#rd" data-url="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzIwODk2MjgwMw==&amp;mid=2247485021&amp;idx=1&amp;sn=21c997ea9376a54308165d13f7587fe7&amp;chksm=977a53c1a00ddad755a4c45098b4d709fac828e9f7e8f5f9b1cebe0a6bff4db831e16d93f43c&amp;token=2100448117&amp;lang=zh_CN#rd"><span>海洋三省｜把烦恼都丢进大西洋吧</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>【提到了什么】</span><br><span>Labradorite stone</span><br><span>Monica's News</span><br><span>Cyanotype printing</span><br><span>旅游路线图：</span><br><span></span><img src="https://i.typlog.com/nottoofarfm/8268143094_35799.jpg" alt="Screenshot 2024-09-18 at 21.52.37.jpg"></p><span></span><p><span>【本期音乐】</span><br><span>Lana Del Rey - Lust For Life (feat. The Weeknd)</span></p><span></span><p><span>【联系方式】</span><br><span>网站：</span><a href="https://nottoofarfm.com" data-url="https://nottoofarfm.com"><span>nottoofarfm.com</span></a><br><span>来信：nottoofarfm@gmail.com</span></p>]]></description>
