  <item>
    <title>26. MBTI神教: T人走脑？F人走心？Really？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/673e79453e619807d55c7b8e</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">673e79453e619807d55c7b8e</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 21 Nov 2024 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>《不远不近》第26期，性格差距“不远”也“不近”的两位恰好一个T人一个F人。这一期我俩各找了几个问题问彼此，看看是不是真的像网上的刻板印象，我们对话中一个处处体现逻辑和思维但毫无情感，另一个重视且可以敏锐地捕捉情绪但毫无理性……</span></p><span></span><p><span>【聊了什么】</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="168">02:48</a> 谁不想被四个字母定义性格？！</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="460">07:40</a> 灵魂拷问，快来看看你走心还是走脑</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="914">15:14</a> 朋友被网暴，先救场还是先救心</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1520">25:20</a> 被老板拎起来发言，烫手山芋朝哪扔</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1820">30:20</a> 深夜心碎朋友来求助，递纸条还是递纸巾</span></p><span></span><p><span>【提到了什么】</span><br><span>《堕落的审判》</span><br><span>《The Office》</span><br><span>《甄嬛传》</span><br><span>《爱莲说》周敦颐，节选：“晋陶渊明独爱菊。自李唐来，世人甚爱牡丹。予独爱莲之出淤泥而不染，濯清涟而不妖……菊之爱，陶後鲜有闻。莲之爱，同予者何人？牡丹之爱，宜乎众矣！”</span></p><span></span><p><span>【本期音乐】</span><br><span>Otis Redding - (Sittin' On) The Dock Of The Bay</span></p><span></span><p><span>【联系方式】</span><br><span>网站：</span><a href="https://nottoofarfm.com" data-url="https://nottoofarfm.com"><span>nottoofarfm.com</span></a><br><span>来信：nottoofarfm@gmail.com</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/64b856c432fb5cf4c968068b/liEyILYOySrt7M84k6nl8u7SRC_I.mp3" length="41956987" type="audio/mpeg"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:47:47</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/64b856c432fb5cf4c968068b/FlQve_uNEXkAK0NaLaJTq9SDULyn.jpg"/>
    <itunes:episode>26</itunes:episode>
