  <item>
    <title>25. 一周年不特别节目：昨天今天明天</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/66bd4583f642967f87d1d734</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">66bd4583f642967f87d1d734</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 15 Aug 2024 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>《不远不近》第25期，值此我们节目上线一周年之际，两位主播回顾了这一年做播客的心路历程。从最初的摸索与满腔热情，到如今的逐渐得心应手，我们经历了不少挑战和惊喜。通过分享这些幕后故事，希望能让听众感觉到离我们越来越近，也希望这些经验给考虑做播客的朋友们带来一些启发和帮助。</span></p><span></span><p><span>【聊了什么】</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="117">01:57</a>   一年前的目标没实现，咋办？改成十年目标呗！</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="497">08:17</a>   播客剪辑的工作量大公开（求高手指路）</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1022">17:02</a>   未完成的KPI：手把手教你如何做博客</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1317">21:57</a>   电子文档的存储辩论：硬盘 vs 云端</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1803">30:03</a>   怎么对身边的同事朋友瞒天过海自己的播客</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2223">37:03</a>   一闪一闪亮晶晶，咱的搞笑故事会期待你的小眼睛</span></p><span></span><p><span>【本期音乐】</span><br><span>The Velvet Underground - Sunday Morning</span></p><span></span><p><span>【联系方式】</span><br><span>网站：</span><a href="https://nottoofarfm.com" data-url="https://nottoofarfm.com"><span>nottoofarfm.com</span></a><br><span>来信：nottoofarfm@gmail.com</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/64b856c432fb5cf4c968068b/llgMs44kVm6XnjZElPHabHVQGhwd.mp3" length="44458235" type="audio/mpeg"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:46:18</itunes:duration>
