  <item>
    <title>22. 独闯墨西哥(上)</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6685e6c3944be941c9104103</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6685e6c3944be941c9104103</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 04 Jul 2024 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>《不远不近》第22期，李羊几乎毫无准备的踏上了去墨西哥城的旅途，语言不通，网络不佳，没有同伴，会发生哪些有意思的事情呢？</span></p><span></span><p><span>【聊了什么】</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="126">02:06</a>    苏苏遥想当年在欧洲的solo逛吃玩，必打卡的竟然是？</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="502">08:22</a>    不负责任的三句话墨西哥城历史科普</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1033">17:13</a>     青旅初体验，献给蚊子的饕餮盛宴</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1304">21:44</a>    漫无目的，极限操作的特种兵的一天</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2326">38:46</a>   花样百出的tacos，无他，但手熟尔</span></p><span></span><p><span>【提到的什么】</span><br><span>现代艺术博物馆门口的怀孕女性</span><img src="https://i.typlog.com/nottoofarfm/8279961751_26333.jpg" alt="IMG_5735.jpg"></p><span></span><p><span>吃了什么（Tacos and more）</span><img src="https://i.typlog.com/nottoofarfm/8279961705_616381.jpg" alt="IMG_8068.jpg"></p><span></span><p><span>【本期音乐】</span><br><span>Snow Patrol - Open Your Eyes</span></p><span></span><p><span>【联系方式】</span><br><span>网站：</span><a href="https://nottoofarfm.com" data-url="https://nottoofarfm.com"><span>nottoofarfm.com</span></a><br><span>来信：nottoofarfm@gmail.com</span></p>]]></description>
