  <item>
    <title>17. 辞旧迎新！唠唠入职后的吃穿拉撒</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/658383d546b817e448cda4ed</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">658383d546b817e448cda4ed</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 21 Dec 2023 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>《不远不近》第17期，两位主播纷纷换了个地方打工，较欢乐的一期关于入职新大小厂的各维度观察。</span></p><span></span><p><span>本集是「表姐妹系列」第三期，表姐表妹，做表格的姐儿和小妹。还没听《不远不近》的两位表姐妹复盘过去的工作、分享跳槽经验的话，请前往前两期。</span></p><span></span><p><span>【聊了什么】</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="76">01:16</a> 所以换工作后，我们去了哪？</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="213">03:33</a> 我入职新司的Day 1，老板人呢？</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="713">11:53</a> J人be like：三周前就想好，第一天上班午饭要带什么，衣服要穿什么了</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="968">16:08</a> 带全妆在家上班新手vs. 全天候穿睡裤在家上班老手</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1217">20:17</a> 混合型办公模式：适时吸点人气儿，Wednesday is the new Friday</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1378">22:58</a> 入职后的心理落差和人间观察：世界原来是参差的</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1609">26:49</a> 我不想被，需要人模狗样的穿搭，这样的想法绑架！</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2143">35:43</a> 假如行走于光鲜亮丽的办公场所，真的可以穿优衣库纵横在都市丽人中间吗？</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2312">38:32</a> 成熟的消费观：管你贵还是便宜，我只买我必需品</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2432">40:32</a> work from home最最高兴的点是……</span></p><span></span><p><span>【本期音乐】</span><br><span>Lana Del Rey - Paris, Texas</span></p><span></span><p><span>【联系方式】</span><br><span>网站：</span><a href="https://nottoofarfm.com" data-url="https://nottoofarfm.com"><span>nottoofarfm.com</span></a><br><span>来信：nottoofarfm@gmail.com</span></p>]]></description>
